{"task_id": "HumanEval/101", "solution": "def words_string(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a string of words separated by commas or spaces into a list of words.\n    Punctuation adjacent to words is trimmed.\n    \"\"\"\n    TRIM_CHARS = '.,;:!?\"\\'()[]{}'\n    # Replace commas with spaces, then split on any whitespace.\n    # This efficiently handles multiple delimiters and removes empty tokens during initial splitting.\n    raw_words = s.replace(\",\", \" \").split()\n\n    processed_words = []\n    for word in raw_words:\n        # Strip leading/trailing punctuation and whitespace from each word.\n        trimmed_word = word.strip(TRIM_CHARS)\n        if trimmed_word:\n            processed_words.append(trimmed_word)\n\n    return processed_words"}
