{"task_id": "HumanEval/103", "solution": "def rounded_avg(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Computes the rounded average of integers in a range and returns it in binary form.\n    Returns -1 if n is greater than m.\"\"\"\n    if n > m:\n        return -1\n\n    # Calculate the average efficiently as (n + m) / 2.\n    average = (n + m) / 2.0\n\n    # Round to the nearest integer, with halves rounding up (towards positive infinity).\n    rounded_value = int(average + 0.5)\n\n    # Convert the rounded integer to its binary string representation.\n    return bin(rounded_value)"}
